WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.520
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and lucasfilm
is getting ready to premiere the first trailer

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:18.830
for the new animated show Star Wars rebels
next week so I wanted to do a video explaining

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:23.440
what it’s going to be about, who the characters
are and which actors are going to be in it.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.369
If you remember last year, after Disney bought
lucasfilm for more money than you or I will

00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:35.800
ever see in our entire lives.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.630
They announced that they would be ending the
Clone Wars cartoon after 5 seasons.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:42.000
Most people correctly assumed that this was
to make way for a new cartoon made under the

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Disney umbrella.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.880
There were all kinds of funny Mickey Mouse
Jedi and character mashups, people loved the

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.600
idea people hated the idea.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.610
But then Lucasfilm posted a video explaining
that the same creative team behind clone wars

00:00:52.610 --> 00:01:00.480
would be doing the new cartoon, that it would
be called Star Wars Rebels, and that it would

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.480
take place during the (quote unquote) Dark
Times.

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:10.110
That period after the fall of the Jedi, but
before the events of The original trilogy.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.600
Then some concept art and and a logo showed
up.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.950
Which you can see here.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:21.170
It’s a departure from the Clone Wars style
of animation, but it looks really cool.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:23.290
So I’m optimistic about the show.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:27.270
And then we got news on the voice cast.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.780
Korra fans will get super pumped because Steven
Jay Blum, the voice of Ammon will be doing

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:32.780
one of the characters.

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:38.710
They haven’t announced details on all the
characters yet, but I think we’ll learn

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:44.970
a lot more after that trailer comes next week.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.200
Here’s the rest of the cast.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.410
Freddie Prinze Jr, who everybody already knows.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:02:02.270
David Oyelowo was in rise of the planet of
the apes and he’s in christopher nolan’s

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:03.820
new movie interstellar.

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:10.270
Vanessa Marshall who plays black widow in
Avengers Earth’s Mightiest Heroes and Taylor

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:14.050
Gray who’s done some other small nickelodeon
stuff.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.630
I’m still too excited that Ammon is going
to be on star wars.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.700
High Fives everybody, high fives for everyone.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:24.470
So on the show the empire will still be hunting
down the last of the jedi, which means there

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:30.250
will be some jedi on the show.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:49.900
But let’s take a quick poll.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:53.510
Would you watch a Star Wars show knowing that
there would be no jedi?

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:57.150
I totally would, there are so many awesome
bounty hunters, imperial troops, rebels and

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:08.040
alien characters that you could do hundreds
of shows without any jedi.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:11.730
But since this is the first Star Wars show
disney is making since they bought lucasfilm,

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:21.700
I think they’re going to play it safe and
give us some force users.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:25.910
We do know that the characters will be traveling
on a ship called the Ghost.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:31.110
So I’m inclined to think that none of the
voice cast they’ve announced are Jedi and

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:41.490
what they’ll do is just have guest characters
play jedi every once in a while as a cameo.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:47.010
The ship itself is a modified corellian freighter,
so obviously they want you to think of the

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:50.060
millenium falcon, but it’s not the same
model.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:04:00.280
A lot of the aspects of the Falcon are there
though.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:11.110
There’s a gun turret in front and the cockpit
will look a 

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:14.590
lot like a B23 Bomber.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.840
It also has a lounge and crew quarters just
like the falcon.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:20.569
But I would expect all of these new characters
to be original.

00:04:20.569 --> 00:04:26.199
The show won’t premiere till Next year around
this time so we probably won’t get to see

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:30.779
part of or even a full episode until comic
con next year or Disney’s D23 convention.

00:04:30.779 --> 00:04:36.620
Remember Disney didn’t do any star wars
stuff at Comic Con last year so I think they

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:40.210
won’t really do anything there next year
either.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:47.960
They like to save all their good stuff for
their own conventions.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:52.460
I’ll be doing tons of videos for this as
we learn more about the series, so be sure

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:57.719
to subscribe to get all those.

00:04:57.719 --> 00:05:00.600
And let me know what you want to know most
about the show.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:05.150
Do you want to know more about the characters,
more about the story, or more about the technical

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.150
details.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:15.030
Like all the places they’ll be visiting
and the tech and ships they’ll be using.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:21.060
As always be sure to like and share this video,
I give extra high fives to everyone that shares

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:23.080
my videos on social.

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:26.689
While we wait for that trailer to come you
can check out all my other Star Wars related

00:05:26.689 --> 00:05:34.530
videos by clicking here and you can check
out all my legend of Korra videos my clicking

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.530
here.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.530
Thanks again everybody, high fives!

